#. Tag: title
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quickguide: Copying a Data-CD in 4 Steps"
msgstr "Quickguide: Copying a Data-CD in 4 Steps"

#. Tag: para
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This Quickguide shows you how to create a Data-CD with &k3b;. To reproduce "
"these steps you need a working &k3b; and the CD you wish to copy inserted in "
"your CD-ROM."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:12
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To copy a Data-CD you select <guimenu>Tools</guimenu>,<guimenu>CD</guimenu>"
"<guimenu>Copy CD...</guimenu> You will see a dialog where you can set up the "
"burning."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ចម្លង​ស៊ីឌីទិន្នន័យ​អ្នកជ្រើស​<guimenu>ឧបករណ៍​</guimenu>,<guimenu>"
"ស៊ីឌី</guimenu><guimenu>ចម្លង​ស៊ីឌី...</guimenu> អ្នកនឹង​ឃើញ​ប្រអប់​You will "
"see a dialog where you can set up the burning."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog you can select the settings you want to use for the burning."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:22 cdcopy-howto.docbook:40 cdcopy-howto.docbook:60
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have set up &k3b; click on <guimenu>Start CD Copy</guimenu>"
". You will get a dialog similar to this:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>In this dialog you can watch to progress of the copying. As soon as "
"the writing of the image-file is done you will be asked for a emtpy CD on which "
"the data will be burned.</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<para>In this dialog you can watch to progress of the copying. As soon as the "
"writing of the image-file is done you will be asked for a emtpy CD on which the "
"data will be burned.</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&k3b; is burning the Image file. You have to wait until the <guilabel>"
"Overall process</guilabel> is at 100%"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&k3b; is burning the Image file. You have to wait until the <guilabel>"
"Overall process</guilabel> is at 100%."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 4"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: cdcopy-howto.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
